ud7.10:2.5 | S: “Sir, where have those laywomen been reborn in the next life?” | T: What is the destination of those female lay followers? What is their future course?”
ud7.10:3.1 | S: “Among those laywomen there were stream-enterers, once-returners, and non-returners. | T: “Monks, among those female lay followers are stream-winners, once-returners, & non-returners.
